  "name": "Hidden slow lead vehicle at closing speed",
  "description": "The ego approaches a substantially slower lead vehicle that is initially screened by a roadside box truck. The lead vehicle emerges late into the ego's forward view, forcing hard but survivable braking in a Euro NCAP CCRm-style car-following encounter.",
  "createdAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z",
